CIRCULAR QUEUE USING ARRAY
A Circular Queue is a special form of a queue where: It behaves in a circular fashion. In a normal (linear)
queue, once the rear reaches the last index of the array, we cannot insert even if there are empty spaces at
the beginning. Circular Queue solves this by wrapping around.

